Input handling (ST2xx)
  ST201  API accepted schema-violating request      Schema-violating request accepted.
  ST202  API rejected schema-compliant request      Schema-valid request rejected.
  ST203  Missing header not rejected                Request without a required header parameter accepted.
  ST204  Unsupported methods                        Undeclared method answered with a status other than 405, or with 405
